    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you deal damage with a Runic Power ability, you can afflict the creature with a terrible plague. You choose which of the diseases detailed in the @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.znbTZAnq6XmdiAKl]{Unholy Diseases ability} to inflict on your target, which takes effect immediately. At the end of each of the creature’s turns, it can make the saving throw specified in the  disease’s description. On a failure, the creature takes [[/damage 1d6 necrotic]] damage per Runic Power dice originally spent and continues to suffer the effects of the disease. On a success, the creature takes no damage and suffers none of the disease’s effects until the end of its next turn. The disease ends after 1 minute or when the creature has made three successful saving throws against the disease.</p><p>If a target is inflicted with a new unholy disease while already suffering from an unholy disease, the original one ends and the new one takes effect.</p>",
